Subject line: Inquiry about Electrical Engineering Internship Opportunities
Dear Sir or Madam,
I am writing this email to show my intention to apply for your company’s internship. I am major in electrical engineering from Silesian University of Technology which was a part of 1+3 program in Poland. I want to apply for power engineering internship. Have you opened relative application progress? Please let me know.
Thank you for your help. I am looking forward to your replay.
