Shaokang Su

AI修改后:
Subject line: Inquiry about Electrical Engineering Internship Opportunities
Dear Sir or Madam,
I am writing express my interest in applying for an internship at your company. I am currently majoring in Electrical Engineering at Silesian University of Technology as part of a 1+3 program in Poland. I would like to apply for an internship in power engineering.
Could you please let me know if any internship position are currently open? I would appreciate it if you could let me know. The CV attached to this email provides more details about my background.
Thank you for your time and help. I look forward to your reply.
Yours sincerely,
Shaokang Su

感想：有好多话想不到其实，不是假设我在说中文就好这么简单的。我的积累太少了，天天写或许会有帮助吧，估计1年后会有明显提升吧。

学到的：
1.补充昨天的规则：
    关系	完整形式	省略后	例子
    主动	名词 + who/which + be + doing	名词 + doing	the man standing there
    被动	名词 + who/which + be + done	名词 + done	the email sent yesterday
2. 问岗位有没有空缺，可以问xxposition 是否 open，这个open是我没想到的。
